  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Citi - HandiTrack Tractor Rental App</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HANDITRACK is a start-up created by a young disabled person specialized in wireless communication technology. Its objective is to train disabled people like him to drive and manage their rolling assets through the internet-of-objects. .In Senegal, this social stratum is often faced with a problem of training and access to employment. Through this project, HANDITRACK plans to offer training and employment opportunities to disabled people in Senegal.</narrative>
  </description>
